  "remarks": "Member of Al-Qaida in the Arabian Peninsula (AQAP) (QDe.129). Convicted in absentia to five years in prison in France in 2012 and then sentenced to life imprisonment by a French court on 3 October 2024 for his involvement in a terrorist organisation. Review pursuant to Security Council resolution 2368 (2017) was concluded on 15 November 2021, 31 Dec. 2025.; Listing: Listed on: 29 Sep. 2015 ( amended on 24 Jun. 2016, 15 Nov. 2021, 18 Aug. 2026, 26 Oct 2026)",
